{
 "about": "[C6] Proof 1 of WAVE_C \u00a77 for chapter V: the player does nothing and LOSES, in every beat with a contest - the window after he runs ([C6 3rd]), the escape down the iron, the alley, the lane, the yard, the kitchen, the press hall, the delivery yard and the avenue (el), the cut ([C6 3rd]), over (the fork), the street (Mercer Street, the corner, the arch), the market ([C6 3rd]), the car (his car's clock runs from when he is in) - each started cold (?start=watcher.<beat>): 'He's getting away.' at least a second before 'Lost him.', back at that beat's start. NOIR_PORT=5346 node tools/play.mjs tools/plays/watcher_idle.json",
